NAME
    tlsdemo - TLS 1.2 client demo

SYNOPSIS
    tlsdemo IP PORT [TIME_MS] [SNI]

DESCRIPTION
    Connects to a TLS 1.2 server over the kernel's TCP socket
    API and runs the vlibc TLS handshake (cipher suite
    TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_128_GCM_SHA256) through the tls_stream
    callbacks, then sends one HTTP GET and prints the response.
    IP is a dotted quad; the default timeout is 15000 ms and the
    default SNI name is 'localhost'. From inside QEMU the host is
    reachable at 10.0.2.2 (slirp user networking).

EXAMPLES
    tlsdemo 10.0.2.2 14433
    tlsdemo 127.0.0.1 7779

SEE ALSO
    ping(1), tlsserver, echoserver, man hosts
